# Copy to frontend/.env (gitignored — never commit the real file). Vite
# auto-loads any VITE_-prefixed variable here into `import.meta.env` for
# both `vite dev` and `vite build`, no extra plugin/config needed.

# ARCHITECTURE.md §8a/§14 M5 — the same VAPID public key set as
# VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY in backend/.env (see that file's comment for how to
# generate the pair). Not secret — it's the "applicationServerKey" the
# browser's Push API needs to create a subscription
# (frontend/src/lib/push.ts), and ends up in the shipped JS bundle either
# way. Leaving this unset doesn't break the app: enablePushNotifications()
# just returns "unsupported" and the "Enable notifications" button becomes
# a no-op past the permission prompt, same spirit as the backend's
# VAPID-not-configured no-op.
VITE_VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY=
